                    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semi-bold text-gray-800 mb-8">C.E.O Faith Henton Interview with KBC</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4 mb-8">

                            We were honoured to have our Founder & CEO, <span class="text-emerald-600">Faith Henton</span>, represent Pamoja Mental Health & Safeguarding Network at #CHANikoKBC.
                            Faith highlighted the vital collaboration between mental health workers, psychiatrists, and Pamoja while also emphasizing the
                            central role nurses play as the backbone of mental health care. She also raised critical concerns about the lack of trauma
                            training and clinical supervision for nurses factors that can lead to emotional fatigue despite their unwavering commitment to patients.
                        </p>
